HOW TO READ
Score = deck win rate with draws worth half a win.
P/M   = times played per match while the card is in deck.
U/E   = unit damage per Emerald spent.
T/E   = tower damage per Emerald spent.
WATCH+/- means investigate, not automatic nerf/buff.

